    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but therapy is about trying to make things better for the future, right? what if there's nothing left to make better? it feels like i'm just sucking the air out of the room for everyone else. like, sometimes it feels like the only way to stop being a burden or a weight on the world is to just... not be in it. does that even make sense?",
