      "content": "When you feel like there's nothing left to improve, that sense of hopelessness is extremely painful and dangerous. The feeling of being a burden is a symptom of the intense pain you are in, not a reflection of reality. If you are having thoughts of harming yourself, please stop reading and contact a crisis hotline immediately by calling or texting 988 in the US and Canada. There are people who want to help you through this moment.",
